OL,3,GNEWSA'Becoming a foster parent is
OL,4,Alife-changing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter thinking about it for years,
OL,7,FStephen Pugh says he and his partner's
OL,8,Fdecision to start fostering has been
OL,9,F"life-changing".
OL,11,F"There's a lot of children in
OL,12,FWolverhampton that need a loving,
OL,13,Fcaring home," he said.
OL,15,FFamily members who had already become
OL,16,Ffoster parents had encouraged the
OL,17,Fcouple to consider it themselves.
